{"id":"vod_sn_38960","vodId":"38960","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"黄金神威第一季","name_cn":"黄金神威第一季","date":"2018-01-01","year":"2018","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至第12集","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/4080589d71c70e0d85b3b24ec741a7e9.jpg"},"summary":"明治时代后期。别名“不死身的杉元”的日俄战争英雄·杉元佐一，为了某个目的而前往能够发大财的北海道。在那里，有着从阿伊努人手中夺走的莫大藏金这一能够一攫千金的机会。藏金被收监于网走监狱的男人所隐匿，而24名越狱犯身上所刻的刺青则是指示其所在地的线索。此时，遭到棕熊袭击的杉元，被一位阿伊努少女所救。名叫阿席莉帕的这位少女，她的父亲被夺走藏金的男人杀害。不止如此，仿佛与杉元的行动相呼应一般，早就对藏金虎视眈眈的北方最强部队·第七师团以及背负着刺青的越狱犯们的行动也开始浮出水面。以壮阔的北方大地为舞台，这场一攫千金求生行动究竟会如何发展……！？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:06:08","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3GUvMe2vsQ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dy1ptLsP2R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RcJepCJcee1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/TCw7Mtt9881/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/8WK7BF7xvY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/L8BTf5h3kM1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZwDXqR2uex1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/heWV5dZuSY1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/BYyzmf4w3R1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3FyyEaeiaL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/hjtf1qLSAg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/bWptsUmti71/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:52.316Z"}